0..59 Comment "//! `outlived` reads a thunk after its holding region ends."
60..63 Comment "//!"
64..128 Comment "//! `pass` returns at its input region. A binding with no region"
129..149 Comment "//! cannot hold that"
150..197 Comment "//! result. The checker reports `TypeMismatch`."
